# Agon 09_sand_testtubepuzzle_dark layer 4 (metroids): kSM_Damage sent from safe zones
# (forced sender: `send ... from`), ApplyDamageGrowth's safe-zone arm. For metroid_growth.py.
@f300 layer 4
@f500 obj u054a; obj u0449; obj u04e0
@f520 send u05f8 Damage from u054a
@f540 obj u05f8
@f560 send u05e6 Damage from u0449
@f580 obj u05e6
@f600 send u05ec Damage from u04e0
@f620 obj u05ec
@f700 status
# Hurtful zone (kSM_Increment -> kZT_Hurtful): the MassiveDeath arm.
@f800 send u054a Increment
@f820 send u05f8 Damage from u054a
@f860 obj u05f8
@f900 status
